homebridge-hon-ultimate-mk
================================

This project started as a clean TypeScript fork of the npm package
homebridge-hon-ultimate 1.0.5 by jayc68, whose package metadata declares the
MIT license.

The current hOn CIAM/PKCE authentication flow, unified appliance-list endpoint,
and laundry state mappings were adapted from the pyhOn/pyhon-revived community
implementation. pyhOn is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2023 Andre Basche.

This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with Haier, Candy, Hoover,
Homebridge, or Apple.
